# 3. EXAMPLES

Convert:

```text
N(r)~r^3
````

to:

$$
N(r)\sim r^3
$$

Source form:

```text
\[
N(r)\sim r^3
\]
```

Convert:

```text
d_eff = ΔlnN / Δlnr
```

to:

$$
d_{\rm eff}
=
\frac{\Delta\ln N}{\Delta\ln r}
$$

Convert:

```text
P(G) ∝ e^-βH(G)
```

to:

$$
P(G)\propto e^{-\beta H(G)}
$$

Convert:

```text
Gmunu = 8πGTmunu
```

to:

$$
G_{\mu\nu}=8\pi G T_{\mu\nu}
$$

Convert:

```text
gμν → Ω²gμν
```

to:

$$
g_{\mu\nu}\rightarrow\Omega^2 g_{\mu\nu}
$$

